title: 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_영문
---
<<show hyun_idle>>
(As I step outside, I see NaHyun standing in front of the crosswalk.)
(NaHyun waves as our eyes meet.)
<<play hyun_sound>>
NaHyun: {name()}!
<<if get("lvHyun") < 50>>
    <<jump 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_일반_영문>>
<<else>>
    <<jump 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_특수_영문>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_일반_영문
---
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: You're here?
<<choice 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_일반_긍정1_영문 "Sure, let's go together." 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_일반_부정1_영문 "I'm not really in the mood to study...">>
NaHyun: Let's go to a cafe and study together~.
===

title: 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_일반_긍정1_영문
---
<<like 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun +5>>
{name()}: Sure, sounds good.
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: I'll show you a cafe with a great vibe.
NaHyun: Do you know where this is?
(NaHyun shows me her phone screen.)
(It's information about an aesthetic cafe with a nice atmosphere.)
{name()}: Let's go study there then.
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: Okay!
(I went to the cafe with NaHyun and studied until closing time.)
<<end>>
===

title: 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_일반_부정1_영문
---
{name()}: I'm not really in the mood to study right now...
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: Really? Then should we go for a walk instead?
<<like 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun +5>>
NaHyun: Let's walk together.
{name()}: Okay. How about that trail over there?
(I took a walk along the stream with NaHyun and talked about various things.)
<<end>>
===

title: 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_특수_영문
---
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: Hey, {name()}.
NaHyun: I was originally going to ask you to study...
NaHyun: But I really don't want to study today.
<<choice 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_특수_긍정1_영문 "Should we skip it?" 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_특수_부정1_영문 "But midterms are just around the corner?">>
NaHyun: Want to go hang out instead?
===

title: 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_특수_긍정1_영문
