title: 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_분기1_영문
---
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: Hey, have you heard of that new movie 'The Outlaws 2'?
{name()}: Yeah, I know it. It's really hot right now.
NaHyun: I actually loved 'The Outlaws 1'.
<<choice 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_특수_긍정2_영문 "Great, let's go see it now." 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_특수_부정2_영문 "Right now? Maybe next time.">>
NaHyun: Want to go see it now?
===

title: 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_특수_긍정2_영문
---
{name()}: I liked that movie too.
{name()}: That sounds fun, let's go.
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: Great! Let's go to GGV.
NaHyun: (Glances down at her phone) We can catch the 7 o'clock showing.
<<jump 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_특수_분기2_영문>>
===

title: 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_특수_부정2_영문
---
<<show hyun_spec>>
<<dislike 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun -5>>
NaHyun: ......
<<choice 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_특수_긍정2_영문 "Okay, let's go see it now." 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_특수_부정2_영문 "Right now? Maybe next time.">>
NaHyun: I really want to see it...
===

title: 밤_5_조깅하기_양나현_특수_분기2_영문
---
<<if get("gold") < 100>>
    {name()}: (Oh, no. Since it's the end of the month, I'm short on cash.)
    {name()}: ... ...
    <<show hyun_idle>>
    NaHyun: I'll just pay.
    <<change karma +1>>
    <<notice "You feel a pang of guilt.">>
    {name()}: Th-thank you.
    NaHyun: Sure.
<<endif>>
<<like 양나현>>
<<change lvHyun +5>>
<<change gold -100>>
(Spent 100 gold to buy movie tickets.)
<<bg 특_영화관>>
<<play 공통_웅성>>
(We booked tickets for the 7 o'clock show and arrived at GGV.)
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: I'm excited. Should we get some popcorn too?
{name()}: Sure. What kind do you like?
NaHyun: I like the original.
{name()}: (To the counter staff) One large original popcorn, one Coke, and...
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: (In a small voice) A Sprite.
{name()}: ...And one Sprite, please.
<<show hyun_blush>>
NaHyun: Thanks.
(We picked up the popcorn and drinks and sat down in the theater 10 minutes before the movie started.)
(We talked while the commercials were playing.)
<<show hyun_smile>>
(NaHyun's face was quite cute as she excitedly talked about 'The Outlaws 1'.)
(She must really love this movie.)
(The theater soon went dark, and 'The Outlaws 2' began.)
Movie: 'You know who I am? I'm Jang Chen from Harbin.'
<<play 공통_와장창>>
Movie: '(CRASH!!)'
(NaHyun focused so hard on the movie she even forgot to eat the popcorn.)
(Glancing at her profile, she seemed completely absorbed.)
(As the movie reached its climax...)
(I picked up a piece of popcorn and carefully brought it to NaHyun's lips.)
<<show hyun_shock>>
NaHyun: ...!
(NaHyun looked over at me with slightly startled eyes.)
(Was that too sudden?)
(NaHyun's eyes seemed to waver.)
(I started to get nervous as well.)
(But NaHyun soon opened her lips and took the popcorn.)
<<show hyun_blush>>
(She chewed it while turning her head away.)
(It was faint because of the dim lighting, but her cheeks seemed a bit flushed.)
NaHyun: ......
{name()}: ......
(NaHyun didn't eat any more popcorn after that.)
(When the movie ended, we walked out while talking about it.)
{name()}: That was fun, right? 
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: ......Yeah.
NaHyun: I'm going to head to the subway now.
{name()}: Okay. Get home safe.
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: ...About earlier......
<<show hyun_smile>>
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
NaHyun: ...... Never mind.
NaHyun: Take care, see you next week.
(NaHyun waves and heads down into the subway station.)
(After watching her leave, I headed toward the bus stop.)
(My phone buzzed; I checked it and saw a message from NaHyun.)
NaHyun: Let's hang out again soon.
NaHyun: Good night.
<<end>>
===